      "telling": "On the left, Appender carries shouldLog, format and write, so every destination reimplements filtering and formatting, and a JSON layout means editing every appender. On the right, formatting is its own interface handed to a sink. A destination implements one method. That is interface segregation in practice: the interface is small because the reasons to change are separate."
